<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African March gold/forex reserves detailed.</title>
<headline>S.African March gold/forex reserves detailed.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank on Monday released a detailed breakdown of its gold and foreign exchange reserves as at March 31 1997.</p>
<p>The headline figure of 13.1 billion rand was announced on April 1.</p>
<p>(Rand million)	    Mar '97	     Feb '97     Mar '96</p>
<p>Assets:</p>
<p>Gold		    5061.42	     5311.23     6737.94</p>
<p>Foreign		 8058.76	     7183.23     7254.56</p>
<p>Total		  13120.18	    12494.46    13992.50</p>
<p>Gold shr of total     38.58  pct	  42.50	 48.15</p>
<p>Gold volume		3.64  million oz	3.71	  4.71</p>
<p>Gold value	    1391.01  rand/oz  1432.36     1431.18</p>
<p>Other liabilities	8.08  bln rand    8.14	  5.24</p>
<p>Total liabilities     36.18  bln rand   35.58	 29.00</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom (+27 11 482-1003)</p>
</text>
